    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3392" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκου-στέον</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must hear</i> or <i>hearken to</i>, c. gen.
			pers., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				1010
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				3.9
			</span></i>, etc. (also in pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκουστέα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.61
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν κρατούντων ἐστὶ πάντ᾽ ἀκουστέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					340
				</span></i>
			): c. acc. rei, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				386a
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				1170
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>one must understand</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι διττῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					9.5.12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.484
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Olymp.
				<u>in Mete.</u>
				337.14
			</span></i>; <i>one must interpret</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνείρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Artem.
					1.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
